 1. acct.owner with no reader defined                  NoMethodError: undefined method 'owner' for an instance of Account
 2. after attr_reader :owner, acct.owner               "ann"
 3. after attr_accessor :balance, acct.balance = 10    10
 4. acct.owner = "bob" with no writer                  NoMethodError: undefined method 'owner=' for an instance of Account
 5. the back door: instance_variable_get(:@owner)      "ann"
 6. acct.instance_variables                            [:@owner, :@balance]
 7. unset @nickname read inside a method               nil (instance_variable_defined? false)
 8. @__secret is stored under its own name             :@__secret
 9. a new ivar added after the fact                    true (no way to forbid it)
10. two instances, two sets of ivars                   ann / bob (balance of other: nil)
